- Track buyer and seller.
- Track energy quantities.
- Track price per kWh or SUN.
- Track currency.
- Track payment asset or payment method.
- Record settlement obligations.
- Record payment status.
- Reconcile completed payments.
- Prevent duplicate payments.
- Produce community settlement statements.

For the prototype, support a simulated USD payment ledger if no regulated external payment provider is integrated.

Clearly distinguish simulated payments from real transfers of funds.

If an on-chain payment asset is used, verify the corresponding transaction and explicitly document the conversion or quotation mechanism.

